max-items 100

bind  h   everywhere   quit
bind  j   everywhere   down
bind  k   everywhere   up
bind  l   everywhere   open
bind  g   everywhere   home
bind  G   everywhere   end
bind  ^D  everywhere   halfpagedown
bind  ^U  everywhere   halfpageup
bind  q   everywhere   hard-quit
bind  v   article      pipe-to "view --not-a-terminal -"
bind  d   articlelist  delete-article
bind  D   articlelist  delete-all-articles
bind  .   articlelist  toggle-article-read

unbind-key h feedlist

color  article             default  default
color  background          default  default
color  hint-key            cyan     default  underline
color  info                cyan     default
color  listfocus           default  default  bold reverse
color  listfocus_unread    yellow   default  bold reverse
color  listnormal          default  default
color  listnormal_unread   yellow   default  bold
